4:51:04 AM [express] GET /api/products/69e90224dce6ba07c9f1228b/highlights 304 in 677ms :: {"tagline_ar":"عطر روبي RF هو مconscious يعبر عن الفخامة والفخامة العصرية. ي intersperse بين وجهات نظر الذوق العريق ويشعرك بوجودك في عالم من附有ه الرؤية.","tagline_en":"ROBY RF perfume is an exquisite representation of luxury and sophistication. It intertwines with the discerning taste and makes you feel like you belong in a world of opulence and vision.","highlights_ar":["فخامة و Sophistication","تجربة الرائحة المميزة","الاحتراف في صناعة العطر"],"highlights_en":["Luxury and Sophistication","Unique Scent Experience","Expertise in Perfumery"]}
